#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tfmini-lidar.rst:5
#: 7c5421e754044e818a073aa8d2d7b99d
msgid "Benewake TFmini / TFmini Plus lidar"
msgstr "Benewake TFmini / TFmini Plus 激光雷达"

#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tfmini-lidar.rst:7
#: ba834af6b4d5405689f710e13344db70
msgid ""
"The `TFmini <https://en.benewake.com/TFminiS/index.html>`__  and `TFmini "
"Plus <https://en.benewake.com/TFminiPlus/index.html>`__ lidars have an "
"indoor range of 12m, an outdoor range of 7m and weigh 5g and 11g "
"respectively."
msgstr ""
"`TFmini <https://en.benewake.com/TFminiS/index.html>`__ 和 `TFmini Plus "
"<https://en.benewake.com/TFminiPlus/index.html>`__ 激光雷达室内量程为 12m，室外量程为 "
"7m，重量分别为 5g 和 11g。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tfmini-lidar.rst:9
#: 190cc65e4d0b4c43be7d0ff835596277
msgid ""
"Both UART and I2C versions are available.  UART has the advantage of "
"allowing easier firmware updates."
msgstr "提供 UART 和 I2C 两种版本。UART 版本的优点是固件更新更方便。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tfmini-lidar.rst:11
#: 79fb2d5e11a442098c7b222ebebf5047
msgid ""
"More details on both these lidar can be found in the `benewake.com's "
"downloads area <https://en.benewake.com/DataDownload/>`__"
msgstr ""
"这两款激光雷达的更多详情可在 `benewake.com 下载区 <https://en.benewake.com/DataDownload/>`__ "
"找到"

#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tfmini-lidar.rst:17
#: 4219865efb554bdaad7b2b3b7bd0e8b0
msgid "Where to Buy"
msgstr "购买渠道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tfmini-lidar.rst:19
#: 29c4c9295077408b94bc491147490a9c
msgid ""
"`Benewake's store on Alibaba.com <https://beixingguangzi.en.alibaba.com/>`__"
msgstr "`Benewake 阿里巴巴店 <https://beixingguangzi.en.alibaba.com/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tfmini-lidar.rst:20
#: a0a85ef2a50d4a48909a26a40d374261
msgid ""
"`Benewake.com Distributors <https://en.benewake.com/Agent/index.html>`__"
msgstr "`Benewake.com 经销商 <https://en.benewake.com/Agent/index.html>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tfmini-lidar.rst:23
#: e5d8b9071b394f59b7d8db62b80cd686
msgid "Connecting using Serial"
msgstr "串口连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tfmini-lidar.rst:25
#: f9ae1e017f344b3d815651155037ee25
msgid ""
"For a serial connection you can use any spare Serial/UART port.  The diagram"
" below shows how to connect to the autopilot's SERIAL4 port."
msgstr "串口连接可使用任何空闲的串口/UART 端口。下图显示如何连接到飞控的 SERIAL4 端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tfmini-lidar.rst:30
#: 47546a49786046ea8710fbd25c1aeed7
msgid ""
"If the SERIAL4 port on an autopilot is being used then the following "
"parameters should be set for the first rangefinder:"
msgstr "如果使用飞控的 SERIAL4 端口，应为第一个测距仪设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tfmini-lidar.rst:32
#: baaa15f9acf14014bf01eee43ce661d1
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL <SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = 9 (Lidar)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL <SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = 9（激光雷达）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tfmini-lidar.rst:33
#: da6494acbf484bed897eae46fbf3f2ca
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL4_BAUD <SERIAL4_BAUD>` = 115 (115200 baud)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL4_BAUD <SERIAL4_BAUD>` = 115（115200 波特）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tfmini-lidar.rst:34
#: 0dac335c21264c5797445de43c033960
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 20 (Benewake-Serial)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 20（Benewake 串口）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tfmini-lidar.rst:35
#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tfmini-lidar.rst:49
#: 4714074a241e402c9a080c2a840ceb53 6b0b5efd0a224af896d981888c492d80
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.3 for TFmini, 0.1 for TFminiPlus"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = TFmini 为 0.3，TFminiPlus 为 0.1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tfmini-lidar.rst:36
#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tfmini-lidar.rst:50
#: 9d2b1f1c6b1242a4a5279160109b94d1 f6deedb5fdf6421c9196d6b9c56bf42e
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = **10** for indoor use OR **6** for "
"outdoors.  *This is the distance in meters that the rangefinder can reliably"
" read.*"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 室内使用 **10**，室外使用 "
"**6**。*这是测距仪可以可靠读取的距离（米）。*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tfmini-lidar.rst:37
#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tfmini-lidar.rst:51
#: 11ef96fda19e4a53a60612f9b8ca38fd bbefe2ec0eaa4a65a6accc7aec2e4742
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_GNDCLR <RNGFND1_GNDCLR>` = 0.1 *or more accurately the "
"distance in metres from the range finder to the ground when the vehicle is "
"landed.  This value depends on how you have mounted the rangefinder.*"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_GNDCLR <RNGFND1_GNDCLR>` = 0.1 "
"*或更精确地，飞行器降落时测距仪到地面的距离（米）。该值取决于测距仪的安装方式。*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tfmini-lidar.rst:40
#: f398090c464b46f599d6f63a3a7d1492
msgid "Connecting using I2C"
msgstr "I2C 连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tfmini-lidar.rst:42
#: 45b59ec999234ded8e0ea2dad60e9826
msgid "The diagram below shows how to connect to the autopilot's I2C port."
msgstr "下图显示如何连接到飞控的 I2C 端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tfmini-lidar.rst:47
#: 3ed3baa315c14f388670090a62f87437
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 25 (Benewake TFminiPlus-I2C)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 25（Benewake TFminiPlus-I2C）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tfmini-lidar.rst:48
#: fae03ba5b66944b48a36d4f80151daf7
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_ADDR<RNGFND1_ADDR>` = 16 (I2C address of lidar in decimal, "
"equivalent to 0x10 hexadecimal)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_ADDR<RNGFND1_ADDR>` = 16（激光雷达的十进制 I2C 地址，相当于十六进制 0x10）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tfmini-lidar.rst:54
#: 662a723d9173454db8b82ee1d2b77a9d
msgid "Testing the sensor"
msgstr "测试传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tfmini-lidar.rst:56
#: 24e32030704540a4baff6207bc820a7e
msgid ""
"Distances read by the sensor can be seen in the Mission Planner's Flight "
"Data screen's Status tab. Look closely for \"rangefinder1\"."
msgstr "传感器读取的距离可在 Mission Planner 飞行数据界面的状态标签页中查看。请注意查找 「rangefinder1」。"
